        functionAndGlobalVariableDeclaration:
            ```javascript-browser
            function f_openModal(purchaseNo){
            
                apex.item("P13_PURCHASE_NO").setValue(purchaseNo);
            
                openModal('purchase-detail');
            
                apex.region('purchase-detail').refresh();
            
            }
            ```
